        },
        {
          "text": " Watoto wangu wadogo, nawaandikia haya ili kwamba msitende dhambi. Na kama mtu akitenda dhambi tunaye Mwombezi kwa Baba, Yesu Kristo mwenye haki, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.1",
